            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Some? (અમુક.) This much? (આટલું.) That much? (એટલું.) Here? (અહીં.) There? (ત્યાં.) To be able to? (શકવું.) With? (પાસે.) Strength? (તાકાત.) Power? (શક્તિ.) A right? (હક.) Authority? (અધિકાર.) A chance? (તક.) Property? (મિલકત.) Wealth? (સંપત્તિ.) An owner? (માલિક.) Experience? (અનુભવ.) A habit? (ટેવ.) A habit? (આદત.) A qualification? (લાયકાત.) An art? (કળા.)"
